  "description": "The Flightline Two 27.5 features Haro's newly-redesigned X6 series alloy frame with internal cable routing & post disc-mount, and a Suntour XCE-28 SR fork. Its 24-speed drive train provides versatility in a variety of terrain while its mechanical disc brakes provides confidence and sure-footed stopping power in all-weather conditions. Its 27.5\" wheel set provides a happy medium between the 26\" and 29\" wheel sizes, combining maneuverability and fast rolling speed. Built with alloy double-wall rims for strength, rust-free stainless steel spokes, 32-hole alloy hubs and 27.5\" x 2.2\" multi surface tires, The FL Two 27.5\" wheel set is at the heart of this model's performance.\nNew FL Two X6 Series frame w/ IS disc mount\nSuntour XCE-28 fork w/ 100mm travel, post mount\nAluminum 42/34/24T crankset\nShimano Tourney TX-800 rear derailleur\nNew Shimano ST-EF500 3x8-spd shifters\nNew Shimano HG200 8-spd 12-32T cassette\nMX-21 27.5\" aluminum DW rims, 27mm wide\nJak-7 mechanical disc brakeset w/ 160mm rotors",
